{"type":"message","id":"fa7516e2","parentId":"42d214fe","timestamp":"2026-04-14T14:18:16.737Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b52d084f548a0c2b67498f1ef27e\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户612847\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-04-14 22:18 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"name\": \"用户612847\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b52d084f548a0c2b67498f1ef27e]\n用户612847: 1、一条飞书消息\n2、每天给我推一条教育理念\n3、不要推送太学术的内容\n4、适用我现在的阶段"}],"timestamp":1776176296726}}
{"type":"message","id":"c69a6679","parentId":"fa7516e2","timestamp":"2026-04-14T14:18:31.237Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user answered the first 4 questions:\n\n1. Output: A single Feishu message\n2. Trigger phrase: \"每天给我推一条教育理念\"\n3. Don't trigger: Don't push too academic content\n4. Done standard: suitable for their current stage (raising a child in middle school)\n\nBut question 4 is a bit vague - \"适用我现在的阶段\" - I need to dig a bit more. What stage is that exactly? The USER.md says daughter is in Grade 8 (初二), upcoming 2027 Chengdu中考. So the stage is \"初二考生家长\" or \"中考备战阶段\".\n \nI should clarify what they mean by \"current stage\" since that's still somewhat ambiguous. Let me recap what I've got so far: a daily Feishu message with an educational concept, pushed daily, avoiding academic content, and appropriate for their present situation with a Grade 8 child preparing for the 成都中考.\n\nNow I'll summarize this back to them and move forward with the next round of questions.","thinkingSignature":"47206fe46a2b44861bbb3337c0d7b8b0a666b0bf9af37e321efea57976c49c48"},{"type":"text","text":"收到，帮你整理一下第一轮摘要：\n\n---\n\n**📋 第一轮摘要**\n\n1. **产出**：每天一条飞书消息，包含一条教育理念\n2. **触发语**：「每天给我推一条教育理念」\n3. **排除场景**：不推送太学术的内容\n4. **完成标准**：适合当前阶段（初二考生家长，中考备战期）\n\n---\n\n追问一个细节：「适合我现在的阶段」——这个阶段具体指什么？\n- 是偏向**学习方法指导**（怎么帮孩子备考）？\n- 还是**亲子沟通/心理建设**（怎么跟青春期孩子相处）？\n- 或者**两者都有**，每天轮换？\n\n确认后我们进入第二轮 🚀"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":92,"output":353,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":31205,"totalTokens":31650,"cost":{"input":0.0000276,"output":0.0004236,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0.011701875,"total":0.012153075000000001}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776176296737,"responseId":"062d7fa8cd8b353c463464a3d5c3ea87"}}
