{"type":"message","id":"a8094267","parentId":"4205b04d","timestamp":"2026-04-14T14:20:23.960Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[media attached: /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/b8550f6f-cf13-47a7-95bc-dd1d1735c12a.jpg (image/jpeg) | /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/b8550f6f-cf13-47a7-95bc-dd1d1735c12a.jpg]\nTo send an image back, prefer the message tool (media/path/filePath). If you must inline, use MEDIA:https://example.com/image.jpg (spaces ok, quote if needed) or a safe relative path like MEDIA:./image.jpg. Avoid absolute paths (MEDIA:/...) and ~ paths - they are blocked for security. Keep caption in the text body.\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b52d0835d10a8b3754d6002b9bcc\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户612847\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-04-14 22:19 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"name\": \"用户612847\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b52d0835d10a8b3754d6002b9bcc]\n用户612847: {\"image_key\":\"img_v3_0210o_c98361c5-8b19-474e-b677-3670270e9fcg\"}"}],"timestamp":1776176423951}}
{"type":"message","id":"715c33ed","parentId":"a8094267","timestamp":"2026-04-14T14:20:30.761Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Another image from the user. This is the third geography image in a row. Let me analyze it and then gently guide the conversation back to the skill interview. The user seems to be sharing exam papers, perhaps hoping I'll automatically analyze them. But my focus right now should be on finishing the interview for the skill they requested.","thinkingSignature":"244678086691767c3627dbfe427e93521f2557bc3f9657a2fa88269924df2e25"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_uv663mjuj0tn_1","name":"image","arguments":{"prompt":"描述这张图片的内容，包括题目、图表、选项等所有细节","image":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/b8550f6f-cf13-47a7-95bc-dd1d1735c12a.jpg"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":92,"output":147,"cacheRead":32736,"cacheWrite":2050,"totalTokens":35025,"cost":{"input":0.0000276,"output":0.0001764,"cacheRead":0.00196416,"cacheWrite":0.00076875,"total":0.00293691}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776176423960,"responseId":"062d8028f04bf8bd6d342ed36c78ddc3"}}
{"type":"message","id":"2575d8c7","parentId":"715c33ed","timestamp":"2026-04-14T14:20:53.779Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_uv663mjuj0tn_1","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"这是一张拍摄于试卷上的地理考试题目的照片。试卷为中文，内容涵盖了世界地理和中国区域地理（以吉林省为例）。\n\n以下是试卷内容的详细描述：\n\n### **第一部分：选择题（局部）**\n\n*   **第 25 题：**\n    *   **题目：** “图中的三峡水电站发电能力世界第一，这得益于”\n    *   **提供的理由：**\n        1.  ①阶梯分界处，落差大\n        2.  ②长江上游水量足\n        3.  ③当地人，新移民量小\n        4.  ④建筑技术领先世界\n    *   **选项：** A. ①②；B. ②③；C. ①②③；D. ①②④\n    *   **插图：** 题目左侧有一张三峡大坝的黑白小照片。\n\n---\n\n### **第二部分：非选择题**\n\n该部分总分为 50 分，包含 4 小道大题。\n\n#### **第 26 题：世界地理（12 分）**\n\n*   **文字材料：**\n    *   **材料一：** 介绍了二十国集团（G20），提到成员包括中国、日本、阿根廷、澳大利亚、俄罗斯等 19 个国家以及欧盟。提到 2025 年峰会将在沙特阿拉伯举行。\n    *   **材料二：** 探讨 21 世纪是“海洋世纪”，海洋覆盖地球 70% 以上面积，产生至少 50% 氧气。同时也提到了全球变暖、过度捕捞、海洋污染等问题。\n*   **地图（图 1）：** 一张圆形的世界地图，展示了东西半球。\n    *   **标注：** 地图上有数字标出的区域（1：北美洲，2：南美洲，3：非洲，4：欧洲，5：亚洲，6：大洋洲）。还有字母 A（指向中东/沙特地区）和 B（指向马六甲海峡）。\n    *   **图例：** 包含了“成员国”、“欧盟”和一条虚线表示的“航线”。\n*   **小题：**\n    *   (1) 考察 G20 成员国的主要分布半球（北/南），陆地面积最大的成员国，以及峰会常在哪个温度带举行。\n    *   (2) 询问某国领导人从阿根廷飞往印度参加会议所跨越的大洋。\n    *   (3) 考察①②国家所在大洲的分界线（运河），以及③④国家所在大洲的分界线。\n    *   (4) 考察字母 A 所指半岛的别称（“石油王国”）以及字母 B 所指的海峡名称及其战略地位（“咽喉”）。\n\n#### **第 27 题：中国区域地理 - 吉林省（14 分）**\n\n*   **文字背景：** 介绍吉林省被称为“黄金玉米带”，是我国重要的商品粮基地。\n*   **图表：**\n    *   **地形图（图 2）：** 吉林省地图，标注了省会长春、邻省辽宁，以及一个标注为“甲”的山地。\n    *   **气候图：** 长春的气温曲线和降水量柱状图。\n    *   **饼图（图 3）：** 三个对比饼图，展示了 2022 年吉林省在全国的占比情况：人口（1.84%）、耕地（5.8%）、玉米产量（12%）。\n*   **小题：**\n    *   (1) 询问吉林省东南部山脉（甲）的名称及其走向。\n    *   (2) 从地形和气候角度分析吉林省中西部发展种植业的有利条件。\n    *   (3) 利用饼图数据说明吉林省成为“商品粮基地”的原因。\n    *   (4) 结合材料，针对海洋保护提出两条合理化建议（此题虽放在 27 题下，但内容显然与 26 题的海洋材料相关）。\n\n---\n\n**试卷外观细节：**\n*   纸张略有皱褶，照片光线均匀。\n*   有些题目被圆圈圈起或划线，显示出考生做题时的痕迹。\n*   页码显示为第 5 页和第 6 页。"}],"details":{"model":"minimax/MiniMax-VL-01","image":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/b8550f6f-cf13-47a7-95bc-dd1d1735c12a.jpg","attempts":[]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1776176453761}}
{"type":"message","id":"2b111b4b","parentId":"2575d8c7","timestamp":"2026-04-14T14:21:04.330Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user has been sending multiple geography exam images. This seems like they're sharing the child's exam papers for me to analyze. But my focus right now should be to wrap up the skill interview - I've been asking about the operating environment, timing, content sources, and whether scripts are needed, but the user keeps sending exam images instead of answering.\n\nI should acknowledge the latest image briefly, but gently steer back to completing the skill interview. I need the user to answer the remaining questions (5-8) to finish the interview.","thinkingSignature":"f70a675a5949bbf67b7749277591df28bfeaf603a9b478f109af3e651b08acff"},{"type":"text","text":"这张是**世界地理（G20、海洋）+ 中国区域地理（吉林省商品粮基地）**的综合题，涵盖了图文分析能力 🗺️\n\n---\n\n频哥，兮兮的试卷我看到了 👀 不过Skill访谈还剩几个关键问题没答完——咱们先把访谈收尾，之后我可以专门帮你分析这些试卷。\n\n**还差这4个问题：**\n\n5. 运行环境：**OpenClaw**（对吗？）\n6. 推送时间：每天**几点**发？\n7. 内容来源：需要我从网上搜**最新教育研究/论文**吗？\n8. 是否需要写**定时脚本**？（还是用OpenClaw cron就行）\n\n回答完这4个，Skill就能开始做了 ✅"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":9555,"output":257,"cacheRead":26328,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":36140,"cost":{"input":0.0028664999999999997,"output":0.00030839999999999996,"cacheRead":0.0015796799999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00475458}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776176453780,"responseId":"062d804506e2bdb95cb06b7cc35fdeb4"}}
