{"type":"message","id":"a531e3c0","parentId":"2b7643f5","timestamp":"2026-04-14T14:24:51.550Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have all the answers for round 2. Let me summarize:\n\n5. Environment: OpenClaw\n6. Push time: 8:00 AM daily\n7. Content sources: Based on Xixi's test performance + search latest education research/papers from the web\n8. Scripts needed: Yes, create a scheduled task (cron job)\n\nNow I should summarize round 2 and move to round 3 (output contract). Then ask about:\n9. Final output format (what it should look like)\n10. Must include content\n11. Must avoid content\n12. Give a positive and negative example\n\nLet me also check if there are any materials needed based on the interview. For this skill, I don't think we need reference documents, examples, scripts, or assets - it generates content dynamically based on Xixi's performance and web research.\n\n\nI'll wrap up round 2 with a quick summary and move forward with the final set of questions about output format and content requirements.","thinkingSignature":"94774e527ebc29fc8575c9cec20b20338f0a561e20976ee2faf72c2b2889362d"},{"type":"text","text":"太好了，全部答案收到！\n\n---\n\n**📋 第二轮摘要**\n\n5. **环境**：OpenClaw\n6. **推送时间**：每天早上 8:00\n7. **内容来源**：兮兮做题情况 + 网上最新教育研究/论文\n8. **脚本**：需要写定时任务脚本（cron）\n\n---\n\n进入**第三轮：输出契约**\n\n9. **推送消息长什么样？**（格式、结构、长度，比如：固定几个板块？）\n10. **必须包含哪些内容？**（比如：理念来源、实操方法）\n11. **必须避免哪些内容？**（比如：太学术的术语）\n12. **能给一个正例和一个反例吗？**（如果你手上有想法的话）\n\n这轮确认后，我就开始动手写Skill了 🎯"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":92,"output":368,"cacheRead":36053,"cacheWrite":648,"totalTokens":37161,"cost":{"input":0.0000276,"output":0.0004416,"cacheRead":0.00216318,"cacheWrite":0.000243,"total":0.00287538}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776176673259,"responseId":"062d8124aa5547084a0eca308833172d"}}
