{"type":"message","id":"bb0a76e9","parentId":"fce3d892","timestamp":"2026-04-14T14:27:06.847Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user confirmed the recommendation. Now I have all the information I need to create the skill. Let me now write the SKILL.md file based on the interview results.\n\nSummary of what we've gathered:\n\n**第一轮：**\n1. 产出：每天一条飞书消息，包含一条教育理念\n2. 触发语：「每天给我推一条教育理念」\n3. 排除场景：不推送太学术的内容\n4. 完成标准：适合当前阶段（初二考生家长，中考备战期）\n   - 内容结合兮兮做题情况\n   - 定位：学习备考指导 + 亲子沟通相处\n\n**第二轮：**\n5. 环境：OpenClaw\n6. 推送时间：每天早上 8:00\n\n\n7. 内容来源：兮兮做题情况 + 网上最新教育研究/论文\n8. 脚本：需要写定时任务脚本（cron）\n\n**第三轮：**\n9. 推送消息格式：4板块（今日理念/理论依据/实操方法/针对兮兮）\n10. 必须包含：理念来源、通俗解读、立刻能做的行动建议\n11. 必须避免：学术术语、长篇大论、空洞废话\n12. 正例/反例：已提供\n\n现在我要创建教育理念推送skill并在OpenClaw环境中编写相应的脚本实现。","thinkingSignature":"809e767d0708b2d2c46d19ff72744838147e8214ccf467684470fcc1d05f1a1f"},{"type":"text","text":"好，开始写Skill！\n\n**创建教育理念每日推送 Skill：**\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ff5hh8zkd3gw_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"mkdir -p ~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/daily-edu-push/{references,examples,scripts}"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":92,"output":327,"cacheRead":37074,"cacheWrite":629,"totalTokens":38122,"cost":{"input":0.0000276,"output":0.0003924,"cacheRead":0.00222444,"cacheWrite":0.000235875,"total":0.0028803149999999996}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776176817239,"responseId":"062d81b19e13ee9f58b5eddc9b821893"}}
