{"type":"message","id":"8018f024","parentId":"cffe569b","timestamp":"2026-04-14T14:27:44.007Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me write the example files and a cron script. Let me create:\n1. examples/good-example.md - 正例\n2. examples/bad-example.md - 反例\n3. scripts/cron-daily-edu-push.sh - 定时脚本","thinkingSignature":"8a676cbe96cd108b058895cb79399c71fc0029112c51814c9ae28ff894a6e36c"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_3g4zixwbld1o_1","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/skills/daily-edu-push/examples/good-example.md","content":"# 教育理念早播报 - 正例\n\n```\n📅 第1天 | 教育理念早播报\n\n【今日理念】错题本是学习的\"导航仪\"，不是抄写练习。\n\n【理论依据】认知科学发现：主动检索比反复阅读的记忆留存率高出3倍。来源：《认知天性》/ Sweller 等人。\n\n【实操方法】\n① 做完题立刻标记不会的，不抄原题\n② 周末只重做标记的题，做对了打勾\n③ 连续3次打勾的题说明已掌握，划掉\n\n【针对兮兮】地理做错的\"秦晋之好\"，这周可以考考自己：秦是哪个省？晋呢？\n```\n\n**为什么是正例：**\n- ✅ 有明确理念（一句话）\n- ✅ 有理论来源\n- ✅ 有3条具体可执行的方法\n- ✅ 针对兮兮有具体行动\n- ✅ 语言通俗，不学术\n"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":12732,"output":304,"cacheRead":26328,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":39364,"cost":{"input":0.0038196,"output":0.0003648,"cacheRead":0.0015796799999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0057640799999999996}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776176853852,"responseId":"062d81d6eb2a4647a789a2c02ce04fcf"}}
