{"type":"message","id":"f12984f7","parentId":"5dc9577f","timestamp":"2026-04-14T14:27:49.241Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me write the bad example.","thinkingSignature":"236a2a4590f3990414c922134bae284f89f2e3218957419cf284e6f1405b9aae"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_19b34x3w22uj_1","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/skills/daily-edu-push/examples/bad-example.md","content":"# 教育理念早播报 - 反例\n\n```\n【今日理念】要认真学习，做好复习工作，努力提高成绩。\n\n【理论依据】无\n\n【实操方法】\n① 要认真\n② 要努力\n③ 要做好复习\n\n【针对兮兮】要加油\n```\n\n**为什么是反例：**\n- ❌ 理念空洞，全是废话\n- ❌ 没有理论来源\n- ❌ 方法无法执行（什么叫\"要认真\"？）\n- ❌ 针对兮兮的建议毫无信息量\n- ❌ 没有 emoji，没有结构，读起来无聊\n"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":13080,"output":177,"cacheRead":26328,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":39585,"cost":{"input":0.0039239999999999995,"output":0.00021239999999999999,"cacheRead":0.0015796799999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.005716079999999999}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776176864064,"responseId":"062d81e0ea770688230965b13d53ca6f"}}
