{"type":"message","id":"ee5b89ea","parentId":"509eb067","timestamp":"2026-04-14T14:28:30.820Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All files are in place. Let me give a summary to the user with the test prompts.","thinkingSignature":"fe5e597da85b61c32c224f5be6ed0ac87cfbfa79ad94a9fec86f99472644683a"},{"type":"text","text":"Skill创建完成 ✅\n\n---\n\n**📋 访谈简报**\n\n| 维度 | 内容 |\n|------|------|\n| 产出 | 每天8:00飞书消息推送，四板块结构 |\n| 触发 | cron自动 / 手动说\"推送教育理念\" |\n| 排除 | 考试期间、太学术、空洞废话 |\n| 内容来源 | 兮兮做题情况 + Tavily搜索最新研究 |\n| 环境 | OpenClaw |\n| 推送时间 | 每天 8:00 |\n\n---\n\n**📁 文件包清单**\n\n```\ndaily-edu-push/\n├── SKILL.md                    ✅\n├── examples/\n│   ├── good-example.md        ✅\n│   └── bad-example.md          ✅\n└── scripts/\n    └── cron-daily-edu-push.sh  ✅（已加入 crontab）\n```\n\n**references/** 无内容，留空（暂不需要配套资料）\n\n---\n\n**🧪 测试Prompt**\n\n| 编号 | Prompt | 预期 |\n|:---:|--------|:----:|\n| 1 | \"推送教育理念\" | ✅ 触发 |\n| 2 | \"今天的教育理念\" | ✅ 触发 |\n| 3 | \"帮我写个周报\" | ❌ 不触发 |\n| 4 | \"讲道数学题\" | ❌ 不触发 |\n| 5 | \"明天体育课不上了\" | ❌ 不触发 |\n\n---\n\n明天早上8点会第一次推送 🕗 频哥看看效果，满意的话就一直跑下去～"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":15293,"output":334,"cacheRead":26328,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":41955,"cost":{"input":0.0045879,"output":0.0004008,"cacheRead":0.0015796799999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0065683799999999995}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776176900944,"responseId":"062d820532c87799c736310ec2d128a6"}}
