{"type":"message","id":"d5bf9795","parentId":"4ed0ac10","timestamp":"2026-04-14T15:10:19.803Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Still expired. The token stored in Keychain hasn't been refreshed automatically. Let me check if there's a way to trigger a re-auth. According to MEMORY.md, there's a `feishu_oauth_batch_auth` tool available. Let me try that.\n\nActually, let me look at what tools are available for re-authentication. The error message from MEMORY.md says to use `feishu_oauth_batch_auth` for batch auth. But I don't see that as a listed tool. Let me check what feishu tools I have available... \n\nLooking at the available tools, I see `feishu_app_scopes` - let me try that first to see the current state. \n\nI could try the message tool to send a channel-specific command that might trigger re-authentication, but I don't see feishu_oauth_batch_auth explicitly listed. Let me just test the API call again to confirm the token is still expired.","thinkingSignature":"2d7df6b5c9b7594cc477db0f3f0c25a6c0080129c2020c2d7084e40369370360"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_pvc6w90meuq6_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","channel":"feishu","target":"user:ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83","message":"请重新授权飞书访问，点击这里完成授权：https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/authen/authorize?app_id=cli_a93534f5edb85bd3&redirect_uri=https%3A%2F%2Fopenclaw.ai%2Fcallback&scope=bitable%3Aapp%3Aread%20bitable%3Aapp%3Awrite"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":31912,"output":355,"cacheRead":26328,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":58595,"cost":{"input":0.0095736,"output":0.000426,"cacheRead":0.0015796799999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.011579279999999999}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776179409225,"responseId":"062d8bd129af1c95c7d2338395c54b77"}}
