{"type":"message","id":"78bc5f5c","parentId":"8ec9d524","timestamp":"2026-04-14T15:11:41.658Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking if they can just reply \"同意\" (agree) to my message directly to authorize. This is not how OAuth works - they need to actually click the authorization link in the Feishu OAuth flow. The feishu_oauth_batch_auth might help here - this is a batch auth tool that might be configured in OpenClaw.\n\nLet me check if there's a batch auth method available. From MEMORY.md: \"当出现 im:message / im:message.send_as_user 等用户身份权限申请卡片时，直接建议用 feishu_oauth_batch_auth 重新授权\"\n\n\nI should look into what batch auth tools OpenClaw has set up to see if there's a simpler way to handle this authorization.","thinkingSignature":"5eb55c3dd5194537fb69c16c615c981ccd8b23586dd295f23bae56dda5e6f3e0"},{"type":"text","text":"不行哦，OAuth授权必须跳转到飞书的授权页面完成登录点击，单纯回复\"同意\"是没办法完成授权的 😅\n\n不过有个更简单的方式——你可以直接在飞书里搜索「openclaw」或「谢道韫」，给我发任意消息，我这边会触发授权流程，然后你在飞书里点一下授权卡片就行了～"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":0,"output":224,"cacheRead":58710,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":58934,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0.0002688,"cacheRead":0.0035226,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0037914}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776179493284,"responseId":"062d8c250d8699ebeb1736994ff09ce2"}}
