{"type":"message","id":"baa7f0d1","parentId":"05488a7e","timestamp":"2026-04-14T15:17:08.673Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Still 400. The issue is the feishu tools are using user tokens which are expired. The OpenClaw feishu plugin tool registration uses the user access token from the keychain, and that token is expired.\n\nLooking at the MEMORY.md note:\n- \"飞书权限卡片处理（2026-04-03 新增）：当出现 im:message / im:message.send_as_user 等用户身份权限申请卡片时，不要反复排查token是否有效，直接建议用 feishu_oauth_batch_auth 重新授权\"\n\nThere's a mention of `feishu_oauth_batch_auth`. This might be a way to trigger batch authorization. But I don't see this as a available tool.\n\n\nI'm hitting the same token expiration issue across all my attempts. Let me check if the Gateway's feishu plugin has an auto-refresh mechanism for user tokens, or if I need to manually request a new one through the authorization flow.","thinkingSignature":"108b313ed8099ec221d1e4cf594a00f62c01a7c90e9b8a35de1ee11ac81e3215"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_pf3zzuapz32p_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat ~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/feishu-plugin-health.sh 2>/dev/null | head -50"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":38650,"output":239,"cacheRead":26328,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":65217,"cost":{"input":0.011595,"output":0.0002868,"cacheRead":0.0015796799999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.01346148}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776179821693,"responseId":"062d8d6d098864c1c69f871307d5b146"}}
{"type":"message","id":"98f22b4a","parentId":"baa7f0d1","timestamp":"2026-04-14T15:17:08.828Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_pf3zzuapz32p_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#!/bin/bash\n# 飞书插件健康检查脚本\n# 检查 feishu.enabled 是否被 Git 覆盖重置为 false\n# Crontab: 每5分钟检查一次\n# */5 * * * * /Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/feishu-plugin-health.sh\n\nset -e\n\nWORKSPACE=\"/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace\"\nLOG=\"$WORKSPACE/.backup.log\"\n\ncheck_and_fix() {\n    IS_ENABLED=$(python3 -c \"\nimport json\nwith open('$WORKSPACE/../openclaw.json', 'r') as f:\n    d = json.load(f)\nfeishu = d.get('plugins', {}).get('entries', {}).get('feishu', {})\nenabled = feishu.get('enabled', None)\nprint('enabled' if enabled == True else 'disabled')\n\" 2>/dev/null)\n\n    if [ \"$IS_ENABLED\" = \"disabled\" ]; then\n        echo \"[$(date '+%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S')] [FEISHU-HEALTH] 飞书插件被重置为false，正在修复...\" >> \"$LOG\"\n        python3 -c \"\nimport json\nwith open('$WORKSPACE/../openclaw.json', 'r') as f:\n    d = json.load(f)\nd['plugins']['entries']['feishu']['enabled'] = True\nwith open('$WORKSPACE/../openclaw.json', 'w') as f:\n    json.dump(d, f, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)\nprint('fixed')\n\" >> \"$LOG\" 2>&1\n        openclaw gateway restart >> \"$LOG\" 2>&1\n        echo \"[$(date '+%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S')] [FEISHU-HEALTH] 修复完成，Gateway已重启\" >> \"$LOG\"\n    fi\n}\n\ncheck_and_fix"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":49,"aggregated":"#!/bin/bash\n# 飞书插件健康检查脚本\n# 检查 feishu.enabled 是否被 Git 覆盖重置为 false\n# Crontab: 每5分钟检查一次\n# */5 * * * * /Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/feishu-plugin-health.sh\n\nset -e\n\nWORKSPACE=\"/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace\"\nLOG=\"$WORKSPACE/.backup.log\"\n\ncheck_and_fix() {\n    IS_ENABLED=$(python3 -c \"\nimport json\nwith open('$WORKSPACE/../openclaw.json', 'r') as f:\n    d = json.load(f)\nfeishu = d.get('plugins', {}).get('entries', {}).get('feishu', {})\nenabled = feishu.get('enabled', None)\nprint('enabled' if enabled == True else 'disabled')\n\" 2>/dev/null)\n\n    if [ \"$IS_ENABLED\" = \"disabled\" ]; then\n        echo \"[$(date '+%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S')] [FEISHU-HEALTH] 飞书插件被重置为false，正在修复...\" >> \"$LOG\"\n        python3 -c \"\nimport json\nwith open('$WORKSPACE/../openclaw.json', 'r') as f:\n    d = json.load(f)\nd['plugins']['entries']['feishu']['enabled'] = True\nwith open('$WORKSPACE/../openclaw.json', 'w') as f:\n    json.dump(d, f, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)\nprint('fixed')\n\" >> \"$LOG\" 2>&1\n        openclaw gateway restart >> \"$LOG\" 2>&1\n        echo \"[$(date '+%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S')] [FEISHU-HEALTH] 修复完成，Gateway已重启\" >> \"$LOG\"\n    fi\n}\n\ncheck_and_fix","cwd":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1776179828797}}
